   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_34c4503bd5600463b156",
   "sourceHash": "34c4503bd5600463b156451c5832c8bb9f85951732cf88e19d064ec32c558acf",
   "text": "如果您的咨询需要临床意见，我们会在作出任何决定之前，为您安排一次由注册阿育吠陀医生提供的免费问诊。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
